      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "What to download / where to put it",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 360 panorama from one photo - FLUX.2 Klein 9B (fast, 2 passes)\n\n## Models (in `ComfyUI/models/`)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors) | `diffusion_models/` |\n| [qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-9B/blob/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors) | `text_encoders/` |\n| [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-9B/blob/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | `vae/` |\n| [flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora_V1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/nomadoor/flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora_V1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n\nAny subfolder of `loras/` works: just select the file in the LoRA node.\n\n## Custom nodes (in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/`)\n- **ComfyUI-PerspToERP** (photo projection + 180 degree roll): https://github.com/shisa84/ComfyUI-PerspToERP\n\nRestart ComfyUI after installing.\n\n## Settings to adapt\n- **Input photo**: load your photo.\n- **Field of view** (`h_fov_deg`): 90 = normal interior photo, 110 = wide angle, 65 = portrait photo.\n- **Texts**: the fields whose title starts with \"EDIT ME\".\n- **Scene** is used by pass 1; **Style only** (no furniture words) and **Back** (what is behind the camera) are used by pass 2.\n- Pass 2 turns the panorama by 180 degrees, paints the back green and regenerates it: this fixes the left/right seam. To skip it, bypass the pass 2 group and plug the pass 1 decode into the save.\n- Klein redraws the photo: it is not pasted back pixel for pixel.\n- LoRA at 1.5 = photo better respected; 0.9 = photo enlarged.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
